WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.960
<b>Dec. 22</b>

00:00:09.330 --> 00:00:10.630
I'm here for club.

00:00:32.790 --> 00:00:36.000
<b>Game 4: I Want to Spend Time Together, Senpai</b>

00:00:38.540 --> 00:00:42.130
You must be thinking, "That's weird.
She's always here first."

00:00:42.630 --> 00:00:44.710
Well I'm right behind you!

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:47.500
This is what you get for all the times you made me blush!

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:50.380
I'll wait until your guard's down,
then scare the life out of you!

00:00:55.540 --> 00:00:57.080
Where did he go?

00:00:57.790 --> 00:01:00.880
No matter. I'll scare him when he gets back.

00:01:00.880 --> 00:01:02.670
He'll be so freaked.

00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:08.580
Why is Senpai sitting in those boxes?

00:01:10.380 --> 00:01:12.040
Is she trying to surprise me!?

00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:14.250
Okay.

00:01:15.380 --> 00:01:16.420
In that case...

00:01:24.880 --> 00:01:28.500
Senpai, I will be surprised like you wouldn't believe.

00:01:34.040 --> 00:01:37.130
How do you like this? I'm wide open to a rear attack!

00:01:38.670 --> 00:01:40.790
Something's very intimidating about this...

00:01:41.250 --> 00:01:43.250
I'll countdown from three!

00:01:43.420 --> 00:01:44.210
Three...

00:01:44.540 --> 00:01:45.170
Two...

00:01:45.460 --> 00:01:46.170
One!

00:01:46.670 --> 00:01:47.380
Boo!

00:01:53.080 --> 00:01:56.540
Oh, Senpai, it was you. You surprised me.

00:01:57.170 --> 00:01:59.000
You bet I did.

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:00.960
Yes, it was very startling.

00:02:01.540 --> 00:02:04.040
Making a mental note to never scare him again.

00:02:09.670 --> 00:02:12.130
<b>Shogi Puzzles for Victory</b>

00:02:14.540 --> 00:02:15.210
Come on!

00:02:16.080 --> 00:02:16.580
Yah!

00:02:22.630 --> 00:02:23.710
Dangit...

00:02:23.710 --> 00:02:25.290
You really just can't reach it, can you?

00:02:26.710 --> 00:02:28.670
Thanks for noticing. Can you help now?

00:02:29.130 --> 00:02:31.540
It was just so cute, watching you jump up and down.

00:02:32.670 --> 00:02:33.540
Get it!

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:35.420
Right away.

00:02:39.330 --> 00:02:40.880
Is there a reason you wanted this book?

00:02:41.330 --> 00:02:43.830
No, I didn't really need the book.

00:02:44.130 --> 00:02:45.630
I'm cleaning up the club room.

00:02:46.290 --> 00:02:47.670
And why would you be doing that?

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:52.080
Well, Takeru just joined, and the year's almost over.

00:02:52.380 --> 00:02:54.630
It's a good time to do some deep cleaning.

00:02:55.210 --> 00:02:59.330
It's true there's a lot of broken and
useless junk lying around here.

00:02:59.750 --> 00:03:01.630
Want me to take it all to storage?

00:03:02.380 --> 00:03:04.170
This is a storage room.

00:03:04.170 --> 00:03:05.500
Oh yeah. I forgot.

00:03:06.210 --> 00:03:09.630
Oh man, I wish we had a real club room.

00:03:20.080 --> 00:03:21.880
Are you cold, Senpai?

00:03:21.880 --> 00:03:22.580
Yeah.

00:03:23.080 --> 00:03:26.630
Darn it! Knowing Ayumu, if he knows I'm cold...

00:03:27.080 --> 00:03:28.750
Here, wear my jacket.

00:03:29.830 --> 00:03:33.040
He'll pull more stunts to make me start blushing.

00:03:33.540 --> 00:03:34.250
Here...

00:03:34.710 --> 00:03:36.000
W-wait, stop!

00:03:43.210 --> 00:03:44.250
How is that?

00:03:44.540 --> 00:03:46.750
Yeah, it is definitely warm.

00:03:47.250 --> 00:03:50.080
But sitting here like this, I kinda look like...

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:52.330
A stray kitten asking to be adopted.

00:03:55.880 --> 00:03:56.960
You don't look like that.

00:03:57.380 --> 00:03:58.630
You paused.

00:04:01.540 --> 00:04:02.580
Want a treat?

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:04.750
You do think I look like that!

00:04:05.460 --> 00:04:06.790
You're a mean one.

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:08.330
Quit messing with me!

00:04:19.670 --> 00:04:22.000
Now that I'm moving, I'm starting to get hot!

00:04:24.040 --> 00:04:26.210
Can I assume this is the shogi club?

00:04:26.210 --> 00:04:28.040
I brought a new fluorescent light.

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:31.920
Thank you very much!

00:04:32.250 --> 00:04:32.830
Here.

00:04:33.290 --> 00:04:35.130
It's all yours, Club President.

00:04:36.630 --> 00:04:38.630
That's right, I am the club president!

00:04:38.630 --> 00:04:40.460
Alright, well, see ya.

00:04:42.960 --> 00:04:45.880
Well, well. So I look like a club president.

00:04:46.290 --> 00:04:47.170
You do, Senpai.

00:04:47.540 --> 00:04:49.210
Here, I'll change the light.

00:04:49.460 --> 00:04:51.630
Now hold your horses, lowly club member.

00:04:51.630 --> 00:04:53.880
This is a job for me, the club president.

00:04:54.500 --> 00:04:56.460
No, but if you do it...

00:04:56.830 --> 00:04:57.960
Not to worry!

00:04:59.380 --> 00:05:00.540
Now I can reach!

00:05:11.960 --> 00:05:12.880
Senpai?

00:05:12.880 --> 00:05:14.960
No, hold on! It's not what it looks like!

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:17.460
If I put a chair on the desk, I'll be more than tall enough!

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:20.830
That isn't safe, Senpai.

00:05:20.830 --> 00:05:21.920
Please don't.

00:05:22.290 --> 00:05:25.130
No, no, no! I'm gonna change the light!

00:05:25.250 --> 00:05:26.670
I'm the club president!

00:05:39.330 --> 00:05:40.460
Look what I found!

00:05:41.630 --> 00:05:42.830
A little Santa.

00:05:43.170 --> 00:05:45.000
It's so cute!

00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:46.960
And it is almost Christmas, so...

00:05:47.460 --> 00:05:50.000
What are you doing this Christmas, Senpai?

00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:53.880
Hmm, I don't really have any plans.

00:05:54.380 --> 00:05:56.210
Just buying a cake and eating it.

00:05:57.040 --> 00:05:58.040
What about you, Ayumu?

00:05:58.330 --> 00:05:59.540
I don't have plans, either.

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:02.880
Alright! The place is a lot more organized now.

00:06:03.380 --> 00:06:04.130
Indeed.

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:07.130
It does go faster with two of us!

00:06:07.380 --> 00:06:08.500
As opposed to...?

00:06:09.420 --> 00:06:12.710
The last time I really cleaned this place
was before new student orientation.

00:06:13.170 --> 00:06:14.460
Oh, I see.

00:06:14.880 --> 00:06:17.040
It was only you back then.

00:06:17.250 --> 00:06:21.960
In other words, the last time,
you cleaned all by yourself, for me.

00:06:22.210 --> 00:06:25.170
When you put it that way, it sounds embarrassing.

00:06:26.290 --> 00:06:27.670
Thank you for doing that.

00:06:29.380 --> 00:06:30.670
And thank you for joining.

00:06:31.330 --> 00:06:34.880
Senpai, do you still want to get an official club room?

00:06:35.210 --> 00:06:36.750
What? Why are you asking?

00:06:37.420 --> 00:06:42.330
This may be a storage room,
but it's full of memories I made with you, Senpai.

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:46.580
Even if we do become an official club,
and get a real club room...

00:06:47.080 --> 00:06:51.920
I still want to keep playing shogi here in this storage
room, where I have so many memories with you.

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:02.960
C-come on, we still have cleaning to do!

00:07:03.330 --> 00:07:03.960
Right.

00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:06.460
G-get me those cushions!

00:07:13.750 --> 00:07:17.210
Could you try to get them,
like when you tried to get the book?

00:07:17.330 --> 00:07:20.460
Stop trying to make embarrassing memories!

00:07:20.460 --> 00:07:21.330
Hey, don't--!

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:29.210
<b>Closing Ceremonies</b>

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:29.210
<b>Winter Break: Dec.24 ~ Jan.4</b>

00:07:31.170 --> 00:07:33.130
<b>Dec. 23</b>

00:07:31.250 --> 00:07:32.670
Later! Bye!

00:07:32.830 --> 00:07:34.000
Bye-bye!

00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:34.880
See ya!

00:07:37.460 --> 00:07:38.540
I'm here for club.

00:07:44.880 --> 00:07:45.880
What's the matter, Senpai?

00:07:46.540 --> 00:07:48.130
Look at this!

00:07:54.130 --> 00:07:55.790
You got a reindeer, too?

00:07:55.790 --> 00:07:58.580
That's right, I found it after we did all the cleaning.

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:00.130
But not that!

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:02.830
Under the reindeer! Under it!

00:08:03.080 --> 00:08:05.000
The TV and DVD player!

00:08:05.380 --> 00:08:06.080
Oh.

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:09.080
Our club room's really looking good now, huh?

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:12.500
We found those when we were cleaning, too, didn't we?

00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:13.920
Do they work?

00:08:14.330 --> 00:08:17.790
Yeah, I thought they were doomed for the trash heap,
but I hooked them up, and they turned on.

00:08:18.250 --> 00:08:23.040
Now that it's here, it would be nice to watch something,
but you kind of need a DVD for that.

00:08:23.040 --> 00:08:26.750
You wouldn't happen to have
one on you, would you, Ayumu?

00:08:27.250 --> 00:08:28.000
I do...

00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:34.380
Not. I don't have any DVDs.

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:35.830
You totally have a DVD.

00:08:36.380 --> 00:08:38.790
No, I do not have any.

00:08:39.130 --> 00:08:40.210
Really.

00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:49.540
Okay. So why did you bring it to school?

00:08:49.790 --> 00:08:52.920
I loaned it to a friend, and I just got it back today.

00:08:53.460 --> 00:08:55.080
Really? That's it?

00:08:55.750 --> 00:08:58.210
Still, why do you need to hide it?

00:08:58.670 --> 00:09:00.830
Is it like sentai heroes, or a cartoon?

00:09:01.080 --> 00:09:03.040
That's fine. I'm okay with people liking that stuff.

00:09:03.330 --> 00:09:06.330
No, this is really just...

00:09:12.960 --> 00:09:16.330
Uh, well... Then, okay...

00:09:16.920 --> 00:09:18.830
You figured it out, huh?

00:09:19.460 --> 00:09:20.710
You're right.

00:09:21.460 --> 00:09:23.630
So I think it would be better not to watch it...

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:27.960
Where do you... buy that stuff...?

00:09:28.330 --> 00:09:30.130
Mostly on the internet.

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:31.750
Oh, okay.

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:34.960
I wasn't really interested at first...

00:09:35.580 --> 00:09:37.790
But then I tried it, and I got hooked.

00:09:39.500 --> 00:09:42.250
Now I check it out whenever there's a new release.

00:09:42.670 --> 00:09:44.210
C-cool...

00:09:45.130 --> 00:09:48.830
I guess... you probably wouldn't
be comfortable with this sort of thing.

00:09:49.790 --> 00:09:50.790
I don't know.

00:09:51.040 --> 00:09:51.920
You don't know?

00:09:52.710 --> 00:09:54.750
How could I? I've never seen any before!

00:09:55.130 --> 00:09:56.290
Really?

00:09:56.960 --> 00:09:58.210
Then would you like to see one?

00:09:59.790 --> 00:10:01.580
You might like it more than you'd think.

00:10:01.960 --> 00:10:03.670
Here? Now?

00:10:03.880 --> 00:10:04.540
Yes.

00:10:04.960 --> 00:10:05.630
What do you say?

00:10:06.210 --> 00:10:07.960
What is he even suggesting?

00:10:07.960 --> 00:10:09.790
He thinks we can watch this stuff here?

00:10:10.330 --> 00:10:14.750
But if I back down now, I'll lose dignity as his senpai...

00:10:16.330 --> 00:10:17.960
O-okay.

00:10:19.080 --> 00:10:20.830
Then let me recommend you...

00:10:26.880 --> 00:10:29.710
<b>March of a 100</b>

00:10:26.880 --> 00:10:29.710
<b>Million Zombies</b>

00:10:27.040 --> 00:10:29.330
"March of a 100 Million Zombies."

00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:35.250
Is something the matter?

00:10:35.250 --> 00:10:37.250
Oh, that's what it was.

00:10:37.670 --> 00:10:38.750
What?

00:10:39.170 --> 00:10:40.460
No, never mind.

00:10:41.250 --> 00:10:42.670
Okay, are you ready to watch?

00:10:43.170 --> 00:10:47.290
By the way, the best part is when the main characters
are about to be attacked by zombies and...

00:10:47.290 --> 00:10:49.630
Quit playing around, and let's get to club activities!

00:10:50.630 --> 00:10:52.580
<b>Shogi Club</b>

00:10:50.630 --> 00:10:52.580
<b>Urushi Yaotome</b>

00:10:50.630 --> 00:10:52.580
<b>Ayumu Tanaka</b>

00:10:50.630 --> 00:10:52.580
<b>Takeru Kakuryu</b>

00:11:10.790 --> 00:11:11.960
You beat me again.

00:11:15.460 --> 00:11:18.540
What's wrong? You seem more
depressed about it than usual.

00:11:19.170 --> 00:11:23.540
This is our last club meeting of the year,
and I'm still completely hopeless.

00:11:24.080 --> 00:11:27.330
I'm asking myself when will I ever be able to beat you?

00:11:28.460 --> 00:11:30.750
Oh, I get it.

00:11:32.580 --> 00:11:34.920
Then what if I play with fewer pieces?

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:39.000
You mean, you would give yourself a handicap?

00:11:39.290 --> 00:11:43.290
Yeah. I never did it before,
because you kept saying you wanted it to be fair.

00:11:43.290 --> 00:11:45.670
But it is the end of the year, and you don't
want to go out without a single win, right?

00:11:45.880 --> 00:11:48.750
If you want to win, then I don't mind
setting a few pieces aside.

00:11:51.420 --> 00:11:54.580
But wouldn't that mean that I didn't really win?

00:11:55.380 --> 00:11:57.130
No, a win is a win, right?

00:11:59.460 --> 00:12:01.250
A win is a win...

00:12:02.420 --> 00:12:03.630
Very well!

00:12:04.420 --> 00:12:05.290
You startled me!

00:12:06.210 --> 00:12:07.290
Let's play that way, please.

00:12:08.080 --> 00:12:10.130
You're awfully enthusiastic.

00:12:10.130 --> 00:12:11.920
Come on, let's get this game started.

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:13.330
Okay...

00:12:22.790 --> 00:12:25.500
What are you doing this Christmas, Senpai?

00:12:27.540 --> 00:12:28.830
Does this mean...

00:12:29.380 --> 00:12:31.960
He wants to ask me out for Christmas?

00:12:33.460 --> 00:12:34.920
Here's to a good game.

00:12:42.000 --> 00:12:42.670
Senpai?

00:12:42.670 --> 00:12:43.630
Y-yes!?

00:12:44.460 --> 00:12:45.920
It's your turn, Senpai.

00:12:45.920 --> 00:12:48.000
Oh. Right.

00:12:53.250 --> 00:12:55.880
Anyway, just focus on the game right now.

00:12:57.000 --> 00:13:00.250
Focus, focus...

00:13:00.750 --> 00:13:02.290
I can't focus!

00:13:06.580 --> 00:13:07.790
Wait, that's...

00:13:08.330 --> 00:13:09.420
Climbing Silver?

00:13:09.830 --> 00:13:10.670
Yes.

00:13:10.830 --> 00:13:15.750
The book you lent me said that this was
an effective strategy against the 6-piece handicap.

00:13:16.330 --> 00:13:18.830
He's not relying on his usual defense.
He's going on the offensive.

00:13:18.830 --> 00:13:20.750
Does he want to win that badly?

00:13:21.830 --> 00:13:22.920
Interesting.

00:13:23.500 --> 00:13:26.330
If you think you can beat me, go ahead and try!

00:13:27.790 --> 00:13:28.750
Ayumu.

00:13:29.670 --> 00:13:31.130
I'm playing to win.

00:13:31.500 --> 00:13:35.040
Of course. There would be no point if you didn't.

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:37.460
Keep talking!

00:13:51.170 --> 00:13:51.880
There.

00:13:51.880 --> 00:13:53.040
There's your bait.

00:13:53.380 --> 00:13:54.880
Go ahead and take it.

00:14:00.880 --> 00:14:01.880
He knew it was a trick?

00:14:02.330 --> 00:14:03.210
Darn it.

00:14:04.210 --> 00:14:05.830
Then how about this?

00:14:37.250 --> 00:14:38.830
This is a good game.

00:14:41.000 --> 00:14:46.670
Yes. Maybe that's why I feel like this has been
the best conversation I've ever had with you.

00:14:48.750 --> 00:14:51.080
Yeah. I feel the same way.

00:15:26.040 --> 00:15:29.750
I know I had a six-piece handicap,
but that was a good offense even without it.

00:15:32.540 --> 00:15:33.750
You beat me.

00:15:39.540 --> 00:15:41.580
Uugh, but I hate it!

00:15:41.580 --> 00:15:44.580
I wish I'd blocked your attack before
trying to promote my pawns!

00:15:45.170 --> 00:15:47.880
We really were evenly matched up until the end.

00:15:49.250 --> 00:15:51.500
Evenly matched...

00:15:51.500 --> 00:15:55.170
Yeah, that's what makes the loss so much more painful.

00:15:55.170 --> 00:15:56.710
But you did it, Ayumu!

00:15:58.170 --> 00:16:00.330
Congratulations on your first win!

00:16:07.500 --> 00:16:08.580
Senpai...

00:16:09.330 --> 00:16:10.170
Hm?

00:16:11.170 --> 00:16:15.880
There's something... I wanted to tell you...
if I ever beat you at shogi.

00:16:19.040 --> 00:16:22.380
I got so into our game that I completely forgot!

00:16:25.420 --> 00:16:29.460
I-I know what this is about.
You're going to ask me out for Christmas.

00:16:29.790 --> 00:16:30.880
Alright, bring it on!

00:16:30.880 --> 00:16:34.000
I will show you that your senpai can
handle anything without breaking a sweat.

00:16:35.040 --> 00:16:36.330
Wh-what is it?

00:16:37.960 --> 00:16:39.880
Senpai, I...

00:16:44.500 --> 00:16:46.630
I'm here to collect your trash.

00:16:47.880 --> 00:16:49.920
Th-thank you very much, sir.

00:16:50.080 --> 00:16:52.040
<b>Trash</b>

00:16:52.500 --> 00:16:53.710
Alright, thank you.

00:16:54.170 --> 00:16:56.750
Make sure to head home before it gets too late.

00:17:01.420 --> 00:17:04.750
So, uh... well... I guess we better go.

00:17:05.210 --> 00:17:05.920
Yes, Senpai.

00:17:19.040 --> 00:17:19.920
Santa!

00:17:27.130 --> 00:17:28.330
That's so cute.

00:17:28.330 --> 00:17:29.250
Yeah.

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:32.210
Christmas is coming up.

00:17:32.750 --> 00:17:33.500
Uh-huh.

00:17:33.790 --> 00:17:35.420
Do you, uh...

00:17:36.250 --> 00:17:39.920
Ask her! Ask if she has any plans!
Be a man, and just say it!

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:44.960
Do you, uh, have any plans or anything for Christmas?

00:17:45.460 --> 00:17:46.460
No, I don't.

00:17:47.960 --> 00:17:52.630
In that case! Do you want to... go look at the lights?

00:17:54.130 --> 00:17:54.880
No.

00:17:56.460 --> 00:17:58.170
I don't like crowds.

00:17:58.830 --> 00:18:00.880
Right, I knew that.

00:18:02.500 --> 00:18:05.830
I spend Christmas at home eating cake.

00:18:06.250 --> 00:18:09.040
Ha ha ha! Of course! That's a good plan.

00:18:09.040 --> 00:18:11.630
Maybe I'll buy a cake and eat it at home, too.

00:18:16.130 --> 00:18:18.250
We're not going to eat cake together?

00:18:20.790 --> 00:18:24.250
No, we can... eat cake together.

00:18:27.420 --> 00:18:29.710
Classes are officially over for the year.

00:18:30.540 --> 00:18:32.630
This year went by so fast.

00:18:35.080 --> 00:18:35.960
What's up?

00:18:43.830 --> 00:18:46.330
They look like the decorations
we put up in the club room.

00:18:46.710 --> 00:18:48.170
They really do!

00:19:02.040 --> 00:19:02.830
Senpai.

00:19:03.130 --> 00:19:04.130
What's up?

00:19:04.670 --> 00:19:09.380
When you put your pawn on 77, I thought
it would be dangerous to take it with my bishop.

00:19:09.380 --> 00:19:11.460
But what if I'd moved my bishop to 95 instead?

00:19:12.880 --> 00:19:15.380
I'd move my lance to 79
to promote it and take your silver,

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:18.130
then you would have taken it with your gold,
and I would play my silver on 84.

00:19:18.130 --> 00:19:21.790
I see. Then I might not have been able to beat you.

00:19:27.170 --> 00:19:27.960
Senpai.

00:19:29.500 --> 00:19:31.500
Back to what I was saying in the club room...

00:19:35.380 --> 00:19:36.080
I...

00:19:39.580 --> 00:19:42.630
I want to get good enough that
I can beat you in a fair game.

00:19:44.830 --> 00:19:47.750
And that's... what you wanted to tell me?

00:19:48.250 --> 00:19:48.960
Yes.

00:19:50.460 --> 00:19:51.920
Anyway, I wish you a happy new year.

00:19:52.420 --> 00:19:54.380
Happy New Year...

00:19:56.000 --> 00:19:57.790
S-see you later!

00:20:12.920 --> 00:20:17.000
I was so nervous... I couldn't ask her out.

00:20:31.130 --> 00:20:32.630
I don't look funny in this?

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:34.500
You look amazing!

00:20:35.130 --> 00:20:37.750
I'm gonna drink so much amazake this year!

00:20:38.130 --> 00:20:39.790
You really like that stuff.

00:20:41.920 --> 00:20:44.250
I wonder if Ayumu is here for
his New Year's shrine visit, too.

00:20:44.250 --> 00:20:46.960
I haven't heard a word from him since
the last day of the semester.

00:20:48.130 --> 00:20:51.580
I mean, it's not like we normally stay in touch anyway.

00:20:52.000 --> 00:20:54.790
Are you thinking about Tanaka-kun?

00:20:54.790 --> 00:20:58.250
What? No! I don't think about Ayumu that much...

00:20:58.250 --> 00:21:00.170
Oohh, what am I hearing?

00:21:00.170 --> 00:21:02.290
When did you start calling him by his first name?

00:21:02.290 --> 00:21:04.790
Uh, it... it's just...

00:21:05.290 --> 00:21:07.750
I hope we run into him today, don't you?

00:21:08.290 --> 00:21:10.580
Come on, that kind of coincidence doesn't...

00:21:10.580 --> 00:21:11.580
Senpais!

00:21:13.130 --> 00:21:14.960
A very happy New Year to you!

00:21:20.670 --> 00:21:23.290
Happy New Year... to you, too.

00:21:23.580 --> 00:21:25.000
HNY!

00:21:25.000 --> 00:21:28.830
Um, if it wouldn't be a problem, may I join you?

00:21:29.290 --> 00:21:32.290
Suddenly I just can't live without some amazake!

00:21:32.670 --> 00:21:35.500
So I'll let you take care of Urushi for a while.

00:21:36.670 --> 00:21:37.380
Hey!

00:21:38.380 --> 00:21:39.330
Amazake!

00:21:39.330 --> 00:21:42.170
I'm sorry. It looks like I interrupted something.

00:21:42.420 --> 00:21:45.000
No, Maki's just like that.

00:21:46.250 --> 00:21:48.670
W-well, you ready to go?

00:21:49.040 --> 00:21:49.830
Yes, Senpai!

00:21:53.790 --> 00:21:55.670
But isn't this a coincidence!

00:21:56.080 --> 00:21:57.830
Did you come here all by yourself?

00:21:58.130 --> 00:21:59.960
No to both questions.

00:22:00.170 --> 00:22:01.040
What?

00:22:01.880 --> 00:22:05.710
I came here with Takeru and Sakurako,
but I stayed when they left.

00:22:06.290 --> 00:22:07.920
I wanted to wait for you.

00:22:08.330 --> 00:22:11.210
What were you gonna do if I never showed up?

00:22:11.750 --> 00:22:14.040
You should call if you're gonna be waiting.

00:22:14.540 --> 00:22:15.790
I wanted to surprise you.

00:22:16.500 --> 00:22:17.920
Well, you did.

00:22:23.540 --> 00:22:24.540
I'm going all out!

00:22:42.040 --> 00:22:42.790
Senpai.

00:22:43.420 --> 00:22:46.790
There's something I wanted to say
to you on the last day of class.

00:22:49.420 --> 00:22:50.380
So, um...

00:22:52.250 --> 00:22:55.210
Will you spend Christmas with me?

00:22:55.750 --> 00:22:57.920
It's a little late! Christmas is over!

00:22:58.250 --> 00:23:00.290
I know. I'm sorry.

00:23:00.920 --> 00:23:03.330
I was too nervous to say it that night.

00:23:04.540 --> 00:23:06.920
But I just had to get it out.

00:23:08.580 --> 00:23:09.500
Okay.

00:23:10.130 --> 00:23:13.790
Then I'll keep my Christmas open this year.

00:23:16.750 --> 00:23:17.880
Thank you, Senpai.

00:23:18.960 --> 00:23:22.580
But I'm not sure we should be talking
about Christmas at a Shinto shrine.

00:23:22.580 --> 00:23:24.460
You're the one who brought it up!

00:23:24.920 --> 00:23:26.880
<b>OMIKUJI FORTUNES</b>

00:23:29.540 --> 00:23:30.630
Bad luck?

00:23:31.460 --> 00:23:32.330
What did you get?

00:23:32.830 --> 00:23:33.920
Very good luck.

00:23:38.040 --> 00:23:41.500
I hope my wish can come true. I'm starting to worry now.

00:23:42.080 --> 00:23:44.290
What did you wish for, Senpai?

00:23:44.750 --> 00:23:47.500
For our club to become official!

00:23:48.130 --> 00:23:49.210
That's what I thought.

00:23:49.630 --> 00:23:51.960
Don't worry. Your wish will come true.

00:23:52.670 --> 00:23:54.290
Yeah! Thanks.

00:23:55.250 --> 00:23:58.330
Oh yeah, you really spent a lot on your shrine offering.

00:23:58.790 --> 00:24:00.330
What did you wish for?

00:24:00.960 --> 00:24:04.580
I wished for your wish to come true, Senpai.
